              Pexp_constant PConst_string(" [start ()] will start the collection of events in the runtime if not already\n  started.\n\n  Events can be consumed by creating a cursor with [create_cursor] and providing\n  a set of callbacks to be called for each type of event.\n",(otherlibs/runtime_events/runtime_events.mli[167,6493+0]..[172,6725+2]),None)
